Package: playerctl
Architecture: any
Depends: libplayerctl2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: command-line utility for controlling media players
 Playerctl controls media players that implement the MPRIS D-Bus interface.
 It makes it easy to bind player actions, such as play and pause, to media
 keys, and to get metadata about the playing track for status bars and other
 tools. The playerctld daemon acts on the currently active media player.

